From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: TheEggmanEmpire <backstage@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 14:40:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] mirrorservice-presentation

Support in-app, mini-window, hidden and full-screen desktop presentation. Share the desktop accessibility service with the agent, route input per display, and retain a single ordered input lane.
